          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:axb-art.-xiii-1-10:block:1",
          "start": 627
        },
        "quote": "(b) This franchise ordinance, when accepted as provided above, (i) shall constitute the entire agreement between the City and the company relating to this franchise, and the same shall supersede and cancel any prior understandings, agreements, or representations regarding the subject matter hereof, or involved in negotiations pertaining thereto, whether oral or written, (ii) shall be binding upon the parties, including their successors and assigns, and (iii) shall not be amended or further obligations imposed without mutual consent of the parties hereto. (Ord. 20503 § 10, 7-30-24.)",
